{"results":[{"url":"https://x.com/PIBFactCheck/status/1318466154302599168","final_url":"https://x.com/PIBFactCheck/status/1318466154302599168","title":"PIB Fact Check (@PIBFactCheck) on X","description":".@PankajPachauri has claimed in a #Tweet that India's imports from China have increased by 27% during April-August. \n\n#PIBFactCheck: This claim is #Fake. India's imports from China decreased by 27.63% whereas India's exports to China increased by 27% during April-August.","language":"en","text":"## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n# PIB Fact Check on X: \".@PankajPachauri has claimed in a #Tweet that India's imports from China have increased by 27% during April-August. #PIBFactCheck: This claim is #Fake. India's imports from China decreased by 27.63% whereas India's exports to China increased by 27% during April-August.\"\n\n## Conversation\n\nPIB Fact Check\n\n@PIBFactCheck\n\n.@PankajPachauri has claimed in a #Tweet that India's imports from China have increased by 27% during April-August.\n#PIBFactCheck: This claim is #Fake. India's imports from China decreased by 27.63% whereas India's exports to China increased by 27% during April-August.\n\nread image description\n\nDD News and 2 others\n\n8:16 AM · Oct 20, 2020\n\n106","author":"https://x.com/PIBFactCheck","published_date":"2020-10-20T08:16:41.000Z","latency_ms":2023.6729530006414,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}